@AmaanBilwar 
remove the key binding from Windows Terminal config then use "CTRL + SHIFT + V" to paste text and "ALT + V" to paste images

As a workaround you can create an `opencode.json` in the repo root with:

```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
    "formatter": {
        "python": {
            "command": [
                "black",
                "$FILE"
            ]
        }
    }
}
```
